{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Because YHWH was not able.</b> Since the inhabitants of the land are strong and mighty, and Pharaoh is not comparable to thirty-one kings, they will say this about the inhabitants of this land: Because He was not able — since it was not in His power to bring them in — He slaughtered them." "<b>Was able.</b> It is a noun."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:49.264842333Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}